{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051210?t=1758784074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051210?t=1758784074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051210/b72d588eb96c992ea323d5a9db3d3540b3b3a046/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758784074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051210/b72d588eb96c992ea323d5a9db3d3540b3b3a046/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758784074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>","developers":["Gattorocco"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051210/c10fb60d9b36b6294a35ee53c749a4a7cf6d9c07/header.jpg?t=1758784074","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Yorunomori Bus Stop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gattorocco"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_a